00:41:52,440 --> 00:41:55,080
甚至是组成宇宙的基本成分
atoms and particles that the Universe is made of

834
00:41:55,080 --> 00:41:57,510
原子和各种粒子也会被拆散
will get ripped apart in what is known as the big rip.

835
00:41:57,510 --> 00:41:59,410
(弗里曼)但是，在这幅 黑暗和充满威胁的图画中
(Freeman) But there is one bright spot

836
00:41:59,420 --> 00:42:01,280
存在一个亮点
in this dark and threatening picture.

837
00:42:01,280 --> 00:42:04,950
我们略有所知的一种东西 暗物质
One thing that we know little about,Dark Matter,

838
00:42:04,950 --> 00:42:09,460
也许最终是最好的研究 暗能量的工具
may end up being the best tool to study Dark Energy.

839
00:42:09,460 --> 00:42:10,830
暗能量是试图撕裂宇宙的
Dark Energy is a force

840
00:42:10,830 --> 00:42:13,360
一种力量
that's trying to push the Universe apart.

841
00:42:13,360 --> 00:42:16,200
暗物质则努力聚拢物质
Dark Matter is trying to clump things together.

842
00:42:16,200 --> 00:42:18,770
这两种东西互相作用
And it's the interplay of these two things

843
00:42:18,770 --> 00:42:20,500
共同塑造了
that has led to the formation

844
00:42:20,500 --> 00:42:23,670
我们今天所见宇宙的结构
of the structures that we see in the Universe today.

845
00:42:23,670 --> 00:42:25,140
通过了解
And so by understanding

846
00:42:25,140 --> 00:42:29,580
星系簇建立和成形的速度
how fast the galaxy clusters form and clump together,

847
00:42:29,580 --> 00:42:31,950
能够告诉我们暗物质的信息
that tells us about Dark Matter but also about how much

848
00:42:31,950 --> 00:42:34,120
以及同时暗能量斥力的作用程度
Dark Energy was pushing it apart at the same time.

849
00:42:34,120 --> 00:42:37,850
(弗里曼) 科学家们试图利用
(Freeman) Scientists using something they barely understand

850
00:42:37,850 --> 00:42:39,390
他们几乎不理解的东西
to try to get a handle

851
00:42:39,390 --> 00:42:42,260
去研究他们完全不了解的对象
on something they don't understand at all.

852
00:42:42,260 --> 00:42:45,930
真是天文学研究的吊诡时期
These are truly strange days in cosmology.

853
00:42:45,930 --> 00:42:48,730
(Frenk)为了了解宇宙
(Frenk) We have come a long way

854
00:42:48,730 --> 00:42:51,030
我们已经走过了漫长的道路
in a quest to understand the Universe.

855
00:42:51,030 --> 00:42:52,430
我记得在30年前
I remember 30 years ago,

856
00:42:52,440 --> 00:42:54,640
当暗物质的概念
when the mere concept of Dark Matter

857
00:42:54,640 --> 00:42:57,310
被视为革命性的理论
was deemed to be revolutionary.

858
00:42:57,310 --> 00:43:01,110
那还是种推测 甚至是种异端邪说
It was speculative. It was even somewhat heretical.

859
00:43:01,110 --> 00:43:04,910
我做梦也想不到 在30年后
I would have never dreamt then that 30 years later,

860
00:43:04,910 --> 00:43:08,320
像暗物质和暗能量 这种怪异概念
truly alien concepts like Dark Matter and Dark Energy

861
00:43:08,320 --> 00:43:10,290
被如此广泛接受
are actually taken for granted.

862
00:43:11,890 --> 00:43:14,760
(弗里曼)说明我是正确的
(Freeman) Turns out I was right.

863
00:43:14,760 --> 00:43:18,330
在黑影里存在着什么东西
There really is something in the shadows.

864
00:43:18,330 --> 00:43:21,730
但我从来不知到 那有多么的重要
But I never knew just how important it was.

865
00:43:21,730 --> 00:43:24,470
从我自己卧室的角落
From the corner of my own bedroom

866
00:43:24,470 --> 00:43:27,200
到人力可及的最遥远的空间
to the farthest reaches of space,

867
00:43:27,200 --> 00:43:30,570
黑暗统治着宇宙...
darkness dominates the Universe...

868
00:43:30,570 --> 00:43:33,210
控制着我们的命运
And controls our fate.

869
00:43:33,210 --> 00:43:36,010
迄今为止，暗物质和暗能量 之间的争斗
So far,the struggle between Dark Matter and Dark Energy

870
00:43:36,010 --> 00:43:37,080
对我们还是有好处
has been good to us.

871
00:43:37,080 --> 00:43:39,050
毕竟，没有这种争斗
After all,without it,there would be

872
00:43:39,050 --> 00:43:43,820
就没有星系，没有行星 没有你，没有我
no galaxies,no planets,no you,no me.

873
00:43:44,920 --> 00:43:47,420
但我们的好日子是有数的
But our days may be numbered.

874
00:43:49,230 --> 00:43:50,930
一天...
One day...

875
00:43:50,930 --> 00:43:53,970
黑暗吞没光明...
Darkness could extinguish the light...

876
00:43:54,350 --> 00:43:55,750
永远
Forever.

877
00:43:56,090 --> 00:43:59,690
直到我们完全理解 这些巨大的力量
Until we fully understand these colossal forces,

878
00:44:00,500 --> 00:44:05,300
天知道
what ultimately lies in store,heaven only knows.

879
00:44:05,500 --> 00:44:06,700
-- 感谢观赏 --

